WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.107 line:90%
Good feedback starts with context.

2
00:00:02.107 --> 00:00:05.450 line:90%
Here is the feedback experience built into
this website.

3
00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:10.858 line:90%
Choose a category, add a short summary, and
explain what happened.

4
00:00:10.858 --> 00:00:14.743 line:90%
The microphone buttons also offer voice
input in supported browsers.

5
00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:18.880 line:90%
Select the exact element you are talking
about.

6
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.510 line:90%
Its location and structure stay with the

7
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.515 line:90%
report, without copying page text or form
values.

8
00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:31.486 line:90%
Attach a screenshot, then mark it up with
arrows, shapes, and labels.

9
00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:34.905 line:90%
Save the image back into your report.

10
00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:41.370 line:90%
Screen recordings, audio, and files are
available when you need more context.

11
00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.922 line:90%
Diagnostic collection is optional, and
starts switched off.

12
00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:49.147 line:90%
Review the text, screenshot, and selection
together.

13
00:00:49.147 --> 00:00:52.253 line:90%
On this site, report text is public,

14
00:00:52.253 --> 00:00:55.802 line:90%
attachments are private, and publishing
requires sign in.

15
00:00:56.917 --> 00:00:59.284 line:90%
Install the open source skill, then ask

16
00:00:59.284 --> 00:01:01.989 line:90%
your coding assistant to connect GitHub or
Linear.

17
00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:04.357 line:90%
Make useful feedback part of your product.
